INTERVIEW TRAP QUESTIONS
======================================================================

Q1. Does Continuous Integration automatically deploy the application?

Answer

No.

Continuous Integration performs automatic build and testing only.
Deployment belongs to Continuous Delivery or Continuous Deployment.

------------------------------------------------------------

Q2. Does CI automatically merge code into the main branch?

Answer

No.

CI verifies the code by building and testing it. Code merging is usually
performed through Pull Requests after code review.

------------------------------------------------------------

Q3. Is Git itself a CI tool?

Answer

No.

Git is a version control system. CI tools include Jenkins, GitHub
Actions, GitLab CI/CD, and CircleCI.

------------------------------------------------------------

Q4. Why is CI important in large development teams?

Answer

CI allows multiple developers to integrate code frequently, detects
integration issues early, reduces merge conflicts, provides immediate
feedback, and improves software quality.

